# Outbound Voice Spec (life surfaces)

## Invariant

`outbound_artifact(operator_will_send) ⇒ Use the outbound-voice-spec skill` ∧ `Use the prose-discipline skill` — bind **OUTBOUND SPEC** before the first sentence; `¬ instruct(model_identity)`.

**Hard gate:** `outbound_draft_in_turn ⇒ visible_OUTBOUND_SPEC_block_precedes_draft_in_same_turn` (or same-thread turn-ref to a bound SPEC). Continuity `## Skills` list alone does **not** satisfy the gate. Next-pickup commissioning outbound must say `Bind OUTBOUND SPEC (Use outbound-voice-spec + prose-discipline) → draft <artifact>`.

**Scope gate (OR):** fires when **either** a claude.ai life session **or** a Cursor **life-representation** / Impresario seat holds the work (correspondence liaison, `vortex-life` MCP, agent_bus on personal/outbound deliverables — including Impresario Fonzi house 17007 for Fonzi outreach drafts). Code-lane engineering without life rep → per-task OUTBOUND SPEC only when an outbound artifact is in scope.

Full binding (L1–L7, tAIm register, FACT ceiling, HOLD_SEND, HOLD/wake guard, liaison pack, verifier): Use the `outbound-voice-spec` skill. Register craft: Use the `prose-discipline` skill. Session-open tables: Use `life-session-engagement`.

## Life-session placement

| Layer | Surface | Loads |
|---|---|---|
| Session orientation | `cortex_brief` once | Lean seat card, deadlines, skills index |
| Matter facts | `recall(op="matter", q=<matter>)` when outbound ties to hub correspondence | Scoped factual recall only — promote into Material attested before use |
| Per draft | OUTBOUND SPEC (Signer, Standing limits, Material attested, Channel/format, Deliverable) | Attested for *this* message only |
| Persistence | claude.ai Project instructions or Customize skills | Across phone sessions — template: `docs/agent-guides/templates/life-project-instructions.md` |

**Avoid:** bare person-entity recall seeds alone as standing boot — cross-domain graph noise invites invention from records not attested for this message.

**HOLD / wake:** refuse outbound draft when matter/mailbox has HOLD or wake does not commission outbound.

## Liaison (Cursor / Impresario, operator not at IDE)

Harvest thread → operator attests material + limits → insert OUTBOUND SPEC + skill invokes → deliverable = **one outbound body or HOLD_SEND** (liaison does not rewrite in Stage Manager / Great Conversation / bus voice). Impresario Fonzi (17007) owns Fonzi outreach drafts — do not spawn a parallel Fonzi voice bot.
